        ],
        "text": "The case Kestutis Zadvydas v. Lynn Underdown and Immigration and Naturalization Service concerns the Attorney General\u2019s authority to detain an alien."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d256a2c260cf84b2c51f36a254425581d4a77e936d8b885dbc2cb815940262b4",
