              "ev-d256a2c260cf-0004-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 75,
              "start": 71
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The parties argue whether judicial review is available and whether the detention raises constitutional due\u2011process concerns."
      }
